    One saved connection, as an icon on a home screen.

    Adaptive, like the app's own, because that is what a launcher wants to mask
    into whatever shape it draws — and the foreground is inside the safe zone
    either way, so a launcher that draws the whole square instead gets the same
    picture with corners on it.
-->
<adaptive-icon xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android">
    <background android:drawable="@drawable/ic_launcher_background" />
    <foreground android:drawable="@drawable/ic_shortcut_foreground" />
    <monochrome android:drawable="@drawable/ic_shortcut_foreground" />
</adaptive-icon>
